    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i guess. it's just hard to see the logic in \"holding onto\" anything. if you look at the big picture, nothing actually has any inherent value, right? like, the universe is just expanding into nothingness. if there's no objective meaning, then all these struggles are just noise. it feels like there's no real difference between existing and not existing if the end result is the same.",
